Addition
- [N1] Added trace (model 1): init(i1) -> action(n1,"Start rector election process with rector's final year") -> action(n2,"Launch acceptance of proposals for rector candidates") -> action(n3,"Rector self-nominates as candidate") -> action(n4,"Stop acceptance of proposals") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n6,"Include candidate in list of candidates") -> action(n8,"Make list of candidates public") -> branch(b5,AND) -> action(n10,"Organize public meeting of Academic Senate") -> converge(c1) -> action(n11,"Begin public meeting for rectors voting") -> action(n12,"Conduct election and count votes") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> action(n14,"Announce election result") -> action(n15,"Conclude public meeting") -> action(n16,"Inform candidate of election results") -> action(n17,"End process") -> end(e2)